Third-party material included in ksef-client-rails
==================================================

The XSD schemas in schemas/ (FA(2), FA(3), FA_RR(1) and the base types in schemas/bazowe/)
are copied from the official KSeF documentation repository published by the Polish Ministry of
Finance (https://github.com/CIRFMF/ksef-api); the forms are published on https://crd.gov.pl/. The
only change is the schemaLocation of the base-types import (see schemas/README.md). The OpenAPI document in
spec/fixtures/openapi/ (used by the test suite only, not packaged into the gem) is the KSeF API 2.8.1
document as the KSeF TEST server publishes it, unchanged; it has the same operations and schemas as
the one in that repository. Parts of the gem follow
the behaviour of the official KSeF client libraries (https://github.com/CIRFMF/ksef-client-csharp,
https://github.com/CIRFMF/ksef-client-java), which are published under the same licence.

